/-!
# Local native bundle maps and their holomorphic gauge coefficients

This entry point combines extraction of chart-pair unit coefficients from
actual native bundle maps, construction of such maps from nonvanishing
holomorphic frames on an open set, and detection of agreement by the
image of one nonzero fibre vector. All constructions use the original
bundle total-space topologies and analytic atlases.
-/
